# Personal Claude Code settings/session state stay local and unshared, but
# .claude/commands/ is deliberately carved out below: those are shareable
# slash-command prompts (like /refresh-offline-copy) meant to travel with
# the repo so they work in any clone's Claude Code, not just this machine.
.claude/*
!.claude/commands/

# Dev-only test tooling (see CLAUDE.md "Test tooling"). Never served, never precached.
node_modules/

# Test byproducts
Tools/seating-chart/shots/

# Offline-copy build output (see CLAUDE.md / Tools/board-check/make-offline-copy.mjs). Regenerated by `npm run offline:build`; never committed.
Tools/board-check/.offline-copy-staging/
AI_Tools-offline.zip
Tools/board-check/.sw-test-staging/
Tools/board-check/.sw-tiers-staging/
